  "worked_solution": "Recall that ${x}_{max}$ is the maximum of a set $S$ if \n\n- ${x}_{max}\\in S,$ and\n\n- $x\\le {x}_{max}$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nIn our case, the value $-2$ is not the maximum of the set $S$ because $-2\\notin S.$",
